# Renders docs/demo/demo.gif, from the repository root: vhs docs/demo/demo.tape
# A macOS-style window with no margin, so no background shows on GitHub's light or dark theme.
Output docs/demo/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1140
Set Height 740
Set Padding 24
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Hide
Type "clear && docs/demo/session.sh" Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "what did Alice send me on WhatsApp?"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 6.5s
Type "1"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Type "yes"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
